From: William Macready <william.macready@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 09:08:18 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] feat(jax): ordered scatter runtime and Lean-vs-JAX
 scatter differential

run_scatter folds source values into a reduceId-initialised destination in the static
placement-table order; node-kind dispatch in run_plan_positional/run_named. New driver
EvalPlanScatterSmoke + verifier cover 10 binary64 and 5 binary32 fixtures (stride, multi-axis
collisions with order-sensitive floats, constant slot, contraction, empty box, B5 groups, chain,
signed zero), bit-compared against runPreparedDense/runPreparedDense32.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
